        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Extension Plumbing Failures</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Many Allerton homes have a kitchen or bathroom extension. The plumbing in it was often not joined up well with the old system. This leads to low pressure, pipes that are the wrong size and slow waste pipes. The problems keep coming back until the system is put right.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Modern Boiler Faults in Upgraded Homes</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Many Allerton homes had a combi boiler fitted in the last 10 to 15 years. Newer boilers still break down. Common faults are pressure loss and circuit board (PCB) failures. We carry common spares for the main brands.</p>
          <a class="job-link" href="/boiler-repair-liverpool"><span>Boiler repair</span><span class="lc-arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Shower System and Pressure Problems</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Many Allerton homes now have thermostatic or digital showers. Pressure problems after fitting usually mean the shower does not suit the water pressure in the house. We find the cause and put it right.</p>
          <a class="job-link" href="/shower-repair-liverpool"><span>Shower repair</span><span class="lc-arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
