        <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.65;">Stay away from switches near the water. If you can reach the fuse box safely with dry hands, switch the main switch off. For the electrics, call our partner firm <a href="https://www.idealelectricalsolutions.co.uk/emergency-electrician" style="font-weight:700;">Ideal Electrical Solutions, a 24/7 emergency electrician</a>. They are NICEIC approved and charge no callout fee.</p>
